Vehicles in ''Human Host'' are a major system: not just transportation, but ''programmable'' mobile bases. Every wheeled vehicle can be scripted in [[Lua Programming|Lua]], enabling autonomous defenders, patrolling turrets, and self-driving delivery rigs.

